    ∧ Eq (Geos (Ang (An A1 B1 C1)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An p B1 C1)) add Emp)
    ∧ Eq (Geos (Seg (Se B A)) add Emp) (Geos (Seg (Se B1 p)) add Emp)
    ∧ Line_on (Li B1 A1) p ∧ ¬ Bet_Point (Se p A1) B1 ∧ Def (Ang (An p B1 C1))" by (simp add:Ang_replace)
  then obtain A2 :: Point where P1 : "Cong (Geos (Ang (An A B C)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An A2 B1 C1)) add Emp) 
    ∧ Eq (Geos (Seg (Se B A)) add Emp) (Geos (Seg (Se B1 A2)) add Emp) ∧ Line_on (Li B1 A1) A2
    ∧ ¬ Bet_Point (Se A2 A1) B1 ∧ Def (Ang (An A2 B1 C1))" by blast
  from assms P1 have "∃p. Cong (Geos (Ang (An A B C)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An A2 B1 p)) add Emp)
    ∧ Eq (Geos (Ang (An A2 B1 C1)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An A2 B1 p)) add Emp) 
