  from assms P1 P2 show "Cong (Geos (Ang (An C B D)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An A B E)) add Emp)" by (simp add:Ang_complementary)
  from assms have P3 : "Line_on (Li B A) D" by (simp add:Line_Bet_on)
